  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coffee World Wet Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant focuses on building a wet coffee processing facility in the Mbale region of Uganda to serve specifically female coffee farmers working under Coffee world, currently they face long travel times to process their high grade green beans and increase female farmers production and processing in the coffee value chain.</narrative>
  </description>
